Subject: [PATCH 1/4] =?UTF-8?q?Control=20center=20opens=20as=20an=20elasti?=
 =?UTF-8?q?c=20drawer=20(WayBian=20"caj=C3=B3n")?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The control center's ScrolledWindow is wrapped in a new Cajon widget that draws
it scaled vertically from its top edge while it opens: scaleY 0.12 -> 1.05 -> 1
over 700 ms with cubic-bezier(.33,.9,.35,1) on each leg, the same bounce the
WayBian bar panels use. Only the drawing changes; layout, clicks and the
blank-window hit test are untouched. Started from set_visibility(true).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013Fj1pDmXVTEisPZxhYu6xF
---
